 |---|---:|---:|---:|
 | experts in VRAM | 17.2k of 24.6k (~99.0% routed) | 16.0k (~98.8%) | **23.2k (~99.8%)** |
 | decode, 300-token chats (median of 3) | 30-37 tok/s | 30.8 | **21.1** (21-27) |
-| prompt, 3K tokens | 554-653 | 552 | **113** |
