-  (`ext_codeplay_enqueue_native_command`) instead of `host_task` + stream sync; a card order with one vendor
+- **Speed.** Per-kernel `__launch_bounds__` equivalents instead of the global 64-register cap; a card order with one vendor
   boundary instead of two (T4, T4, B60, B60); tensor-core prompt kernels for NVIDIA in place of the stubbed XMX ones.
   The prompt path (113 tok/s) is where the T4 stages hurt most.
 - `--pipeline-windows` (its second hand-off, `hand_b`) and `--parallel` / `--batch` slots on a mixed split: not run.
